 379                 /       VERIFICATION BY DEFAULT. SINCE /Y WAS NOT INVOKED, THE USER WAS QUERIED
 380                 /       WHETHER TO ACTUALLY KILL THE FILE(S). SINCE /S WAS INVOKED, RESPONSE MODE
 381                 /       OPERATION WAS PREVENTED AND FILMAN EXITS TO THE MONITOR.
 382   
